# Campus Food Delivery and Order Management System

This Python system digitizes campus canteen food ordering.

## Requirements implemented
- 10 menu items in 3 categories: Meals, Drinks and Snacks.
- Multiple items and quantities per order.
- Automatic subtotal and distance-based delivery fee.
- Free delivery for orders of UGX 50,000 or more.
- Four predefined riders.
- Rider availability tracking.
- Logical status progression:
  Pending -> Preparing -> Out for Delivery -> Delivered
- Prevention of skipped status stages.
- Revenue and best-selling-item reports.
- Number of orders in every status.
- JSON persistence between program sessions.
- Graceful handling of missing or damaged files.
- Menu-driven program with input validation.

## Run
Open the terminal in this folder and run:

python main.py

No external Python packages are required.

## Suggested group division
Member 1: menu_data.py
Member 2: orders.py
Member 3: riders.py
Member 4: reports.py
Member 5: persistence.py and main.py

Every member should understand the whole project before the viva.
